# This repository tracks its CAD and print files (STL, STEP, 3MF), renders and archives on purpose,
# so those file types are not ignored. What is ignored is listed here.

# Third-party model (Printables 942972): download it from Printables, never commit it
*Printables-942972*
UCG_U 10inch rack mount.stl

# Backups and scratch files from CAD and Blender
*.blend1
*.bak
*~

# AI session notes (kept on disk, not published)
CLAUDE.md
HANDOFF_FOR_NEXT_AGENT.md
PROGRESS_*.md

# Python cache and build
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.pytest_cache/

# OS metadata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
